\begin{MintedVerbatim}[commandchars=\\\{\}]
(λ. 0) (bvar 1)            \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} identity applied to a free variable
body = bvar 0, arg = bvar 1

Without shift\PYGZhy{}up:  subst 0 (bvar 1) (bvar 0) = bvar 1
                   shift (\PYGZhy{}1) 0 (bvar 1)      = bvar 0    ✗ wrong variable!

With shift\PYGZhy{}up:     shift 1 0 (bvar 1)         = bvar 2
                   subst 0 (bvar 2) (bvar 0)  = bvar 2
                   shift (\PYGZhy{}1) 0 (bvar 2)      = bvar 1    ✓ correct!
\end{MintedVerbatim}
